(Japanese: '''ポケモンだじゃれクラブ　ゴージャス！''' ''Pokémon Pun Club: Gorgeous!'') is a [[Pokémon 4Koma]] {{pkmn|manga}} created by 春風邪三太 [[Santa Harukaze]]. It was serialized in the [[Pokémon Fan (Japan)|Pokémon Fan]] magazine as (Japanese: '''ポケモン超だじゃれクラブ''' ''Pokémon Super Pun Club''). It is 192 pages long.

